Z||000007||cadaver||06-18-2001||01:48 AM||||ok here we go again.<BR>get a cheap steering wheel puller and a cheap lock plate remover.This will be less than $20.<P>Remove the steering wheel. Remove the lock plate. Remove the turn signal cam stuff. And tighten three out of the four screws. Be sure to use loc tite. and be done with it.<P>I did mine on my lunch hour one day. Someone say me doing it and the next day I was doing there blazer's. Same column.||||reg||1
