Z||000012||ChadMan||06-19-2001||08:50 AM||||If you're gentle with your tilt mechanism, it won't get any worse.  Mine is holding at about 1/4" to 1/2" inch of wiggle at the rim and hasn't gotten any worse in the past year or so.||||reg||1
